  "contentHtml": "<p>염색약이 스며들 시간 충분히 줬음에도 불구하고 대부분의 조에서 핵이 염색되지 않았고, 일부 염색된 조에서도 핵이 붉은색으로 염색되는 것이 아니라 진한 초록색으로 염색이 됩니다.</p><p>더 얇고 어린 검정말 잎을 써야 했는데 두꺼운 걸 써서 이렇게 된 걸까요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d746b6f56851a7120e0b904c336412c1f61e2d33\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d746b6f56851a7120e0b904c336412c1f61e2d33\" data-origin-width=\"1346\" data-origin-height=\"1646\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fb0a40246def4cf8cf67911259f41a08d32e4fa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fb0a40246def4cf8cf67911259f41a08d32e4fa\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"2448\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/520de43e137d0af6c0e7fabddb3309640fd583bf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/520de43e137d0af6c0e7fabddb3309640fd583bf\" data-origin-width=\"1261\" data-origin-height=\"1500\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdb2466371c2a442b7c35c3b4050834412b0a9d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdb2466371c2a442b7c35c3b4050834412b0a9d9\" data-origin-width=\"1257\" data-origin-height=\"1414\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2ae0e451911c77b1273565aac7def128b5ac6c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2ae0e451911c77b1273565aac7def128b5ac6c7\" data-origin-width=\"1504\" data-origin-height=\"1128\"></div><p>아래 사진들은 수업시간에 애들이 찍은 건데 그냥 자랑하고 싶어 올려봅니다 ㅎㅎ</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
